  aciklama:
  - "Senin i\xE7in yakt\u0131\u011F\u0131m ate\u015Fin alevi resmen alt\u0131n sar\u0131s\u0131.
    Cay\u0131r cay\u0131r yan\u0131yor. Seni hem ni\u015Fanl\u0131nla olan ili\u015Fkinde
    hem de \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n sekt\xF6rde muhte\u015Fem g\xFCnler
    bekliyor {{isim}}. \xD6n\xFCn\xFCz ve gelece\u011Finiz \xE7ok a\xE7\u0131k. \u0130nan\u0131lmaz
    mutlu y\u0131llar\u0131n\u0131z olacak. 3 ay sonra bir per\u015Fembe g\xFCn\xFC
    ya\u015Fayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131z g\xFCzel bir de geli\u015Fme g\xF6r\xFCyorum."
